      "review_summary": "The branch changes the OpenAI realtime voice provider to suppress server-VAD auto responses around manual response turns, restore them after terminal events, and adds focused provider tests plus a changelog entry.\n\nPR surface: Source +51, Tests +193, Docs +1. Total +245 across 3 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Current main source still combines voice-call ready-trigger greetings with OpenAI server VAD create_response defaulting true; I did not rerun a live phone call in this read-only review.",
